Z||000000||Oreif||12-11-2000||10:22 AM||||In the spring I lowered my Fiero. The clearence is 4". The overall height of the car is 43" (45" to the top of the scoop).<BR>My difficulty is we are getting 15" of snow today! That is 1/3 the height of my car!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>Anyone know of a good plow kit for a Fiero?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I was thinking one of those big deep V style with the little windows so I could see thru the blade. <BR>(LOL)<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||12
Z||000001||bHooper||12-11-2000||10:27 AM||||might i suggest installing plame thrower's on the front?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>that way, you could just melt the stuff!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>of course, it would quickly turn to ice, for all those behind you  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>another option, would be to have a "monster" lift kit.  <P>hoop||||reg||1
