Z||000005||sqoach||12-11-2000||12:38 PM||||well, we don't have snow here, but we have lotsa ice. driving home from work last night was pretty scary. first of all, my car's been sitting in the parking lot since 9:30 in the morning. when i went out to my car, it was about 6:00, the windshield and driver's window probably had a 1/4 inch layer of ice. i had to use my little keychain thing to scrape off the ice cuz i didn't have a scraper. all the way home i kept it in 1st and 2nd. only slipped once, but i think any car would have in this spot. it kinda surprised me, my car handles better than i thought it would.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>sorry for the semi-o/t<P>------------------<BR>sQoaCh<BR>fiero7@hotmail.com<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig_2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
