Z||000009||Tryxalon||12-11-2000||08:08 PM||||Yeah, got lots of snow here today (Grand Rapid MI) and with one car in the shop &lt;br&gt; <BR>OF COURSE I had to drive the Fiero!! :^).  <P>Funny thing about mid-engine cars with body-pans. My Fiero is almost light enough to "slide" across the snow (like my old X1/9, although I admit to wanting tires with a little more 'grip'. <P>The other trick (other that think FAR AHEAD) is to MAINTAIN MOMENTUM!! <P>Of course the hardest technique is to AVOID THE ASSHOLES!!! <P>Compared to them, snow is no problem. <P><p>[This message has been edited by Tryxalon (edited 12-11-2000).]||||reg||6
